OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith's husband dies aged 85
OL,4,
OL,5,FMichael Wynn Jones, the husband of TV
OL,6,Fcook Delia Smith, has died at the age
OL,7,Fof 85.
OL,9,FTogether with Smith, he was a majority
OL,10,Fshareholder at Norwich City Football
OL,11,FClub for 28 years before stepping back
OL,12,Fin 2025.
OL,14,F"Michael died peacefully at home on
OL,15,FMonday morning," the Championship club
OL,16,Fsaid, adding he would be "greatly
OL,17,Fmissed".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
