OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith's husband dies aged 85
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe couple, who lived near Stowmarket
OL,6,Fin Suffolk, became defining figures in
OL,7,Fthe Canaries' history, overseeing
OL,8,Fseveral promotions to the Premier
OL,9,FLeague.
